      "title": "A simple measure of electron localization in atomic and molecular systems",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>We introduce in this work a new approach to the identification of localized electronic groups in atomic and molecular systems. Our approach is based on local behavior of the Hartree\u2013Fock parallel-spin pair probability and is completely independent of unitary orbital transformations. We derive a simple \u2018\u2018electron localization function\u2019\u2019 (ELF) which easily reveals atomic shell structure and core, binding, and lone electron pairs in simple molecular systems as well.</jats:p>",
